10 REM *** LOGIC GARDEN 64N: APOCALYPSE NOW ***
20 REM *** MATT'S INDUSTRIALIST PROTOCOL ***
30 V=53248: S=54272: SC=1024: CO=55296
40 POKE 53280,0: POKE 53281,0: PRINT CHR$(147) :REM BLACK/BLACK/CLR

100 REM *** PHASE 1: THE NAPALM SKY ***
110 REM BAND 1: YELLOW (TOP)
120 FOR I=0 TO 7: FOR J=0 TO 39
130 POKE SC+(I*40)+J, 160: POKE CO+(I*40)+J, 7
140 NEXT J: NEXT I
150 REM BAND 2: ORANGE (MID)
160 FOR I=8 TO 15: FOR J=0 TO 39
170 POKE SC+(I*40)+J, 160: POKE CO+(I*40)+J, 8
180 NEXT J: NEXT I
190 REM BAND 3: RED (LOW)
200 FOR I=16 TO 22: FOR J=0 TO 39
210 POKE SC+(I*40)+J, 160: POKE CO+(I*40)+J, 2
220 NEXT J: NEXT I
230 REM BAND 4: THE JUNGLE (BLACK/GREEN NOISE)
240 FOR I=23 TO 24: FOR J=0 TO 39
250 R=INT(RND(1)*2): C=5: IF R=1 THEN C=11
260 POKE SC+(I*40)+J, 102: POKE CO+(I*40)+J, C
270 NEXT J: NEXT I

300 REM *** PHASE 2: HUEY SPRITE DATA ***
310 P=12288 :REM $3000 (BLK 192)
320 REM FRAME 1: ROTOR X
330 FOR I=0 TO 62: READ D: POKE P+I, D: NEXT
340 REM FRAME 2: ROTOR FLAT
350 FOR I=0 TO 62: READ D: POKE P+64+I, D: NEXT

400 REM *** PHASE 3: SPRITE SETUP ***
410 POKE V+21, 7: REM ENABLE SPRITES 0,1,2
420 POKE V+39, 0: POKE V+40, 0: POKE V+41, 0 :REM ALL BLACK
430 X=50: Y=100: ANI=0
440 REM SETUP SID (WAGNER)
450 POKE S+24, 15: POKE S+5, 9: POKE S+6, 0: POKE S+4, 33

500 REM *** MAIN LOOP ***
510 REM MOVE HELICOPTERS (FORMATION FLIGHT)
520 POKE V+0, X: POKE V+1, Y
530 POKE V+2, X-30: POKE V+3, Y-20 :REM WINGMAN 1
540 POKE V+4, X-40: POKE V+5, Y+15 :REM WINGMAN 2

550 REM ANIMATE ROTORS
560 ANI=1-ANI
570 IF ANI=1 THEN B=192 ELSE B=193
580 POKE 2040, B: POKE 2041, B: POKE 2042, B

590 REM PLAY WAGNER NOTE (FROM DATA)
600 READ LO: READ HI
610 IF LO=255 THEN RESTORE 2000: GOTO 600 :REM LOOP MUSIC
620 POKE S, LO: POKE S+1, HI
630 POKE S+4, 33 :REM TRIGGER SAWTOOTH

640 REM UPDATE POSITION
650 X=X+2: IF X>300 THEN X=20
660 POKE V+16, 0: IF X>255 THEN POKE V+16, 7 :REM MSB FOR ALL

670 FOR D=1 TO 50: NEXT :REM DELAY
680 POKE S+4, 32 :REM RELEASE NOTE
690 GOTO 500

